      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "User resources",
      "items": [
        "A PersistentVolumeClaim is a user's storage request",
        "Pods access PVs through PVCs (pvc-1 8Gi → pv-1 10Gi, pvc-2 5Gi → pv-3 5Gi)",
        "pv-2 (20Gi) has no claim and remains unbound"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
